<ComponentLayout title="Analytical Components">
  <h1>Analytical Components</h1>

  <p>These components provide interactive visualisations of theoretical calculations and analytical logic, designed to connect abstract PPT concepts directly to user input.</p>

  <hr style="margin: 3rem 0; border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;" />

  <h2 id="prime-lattice-profiler">Prime Harmonic Profiler</h2>
  
  <p>The Prime Harmonic Profiler is an interactive tool that computes and visualizes the Prime Family power sets of user-submitted pitch chords based on dynamic tuning limits.</p>

  <p>Due to the complexity of the interface, the Harmonic Profiler has been migrated to a dedicated full-page application view.</p>

  <p><a href="/harmonic-profiler" style="display: inline-block; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; background: #4f46e5; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold;">Launch Prime Harmonic Profiler Studio</a></p>
</ComponentLayout>

<style>
  .demo-box {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e2e8f0);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #f8fafc;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }
  ppt-prime-lattice-profiler {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
  }
</style>
